# Brief message

Use the shared **CursorSites brief message** pattern. Full spec:

`C:\CursorSites\cursor-sites-shared\ui\BRIEF_MESSAGE.md`

- Utility: `assets/js/utils/brief-message.js` (synced from `cursor-sites-shared`)
- Styles: `assets/css/brief-message.css` + Splitify pill overrides in `style.css` (`.app--bill .brief-message`)
- API: `BriefMessage.show(text, anchorEl, { durationMs: 1200, disableElement })`
- Do **not** duplicate inline implementations in page scripts
